sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer app
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant S as Scheduler service
    participant R as Redis ledger
    participant DB as PostgreSQL primary
    participant MQ as Broker

    C->>GW: GET availability (JWT)
    GW->>S: forward + identity headers
    S->>R: read ledger + catalog
    S-->>C: free start times
    C->>GW: POST /holds 09:00
    GW->>S: forward
    S->>R: Lua acquire_hold (atomic)
    alt pair free
        R-->>S: holdId, bay, technician
        S-->>C: 201 held for 10 min
    else all taken
        R-->>S: none
        S-->>C: 409 + alternatives (no DB call)
    end
    C->>GW: POST /appointments holdId + Idempotency-Key
    GW->>S: forward
    S->>DB: BEGIN, insert key, appointment, 2 reservations, outbox
    alt EXCLUDE ok
        DB-->>S: COMMIT
        S->>R: hold to confirmed
        S-->>C: 201 appointment
    else 23P01 overlap
        DB-->>S: ROLLBACK
        S->>R: mark ledger dirty
        S-->>C: 409 + alternatives
    end
    Note over S,MQ: Outbox relay publishes AppointmentBooked later
    S--)MQ: AppointmentBooked
